     "Define a missing acknowledgment as no recorded response within the review window despite a send record. A missing acknowledgment is not the same as a late one, and it may indicate a delivery problem that needs follow-up. Report missing acknowledgments separately and route them to the hold owner. The study should not guess what happened."
